# The local screen (ADR-033): Kura Desktop on the machine's own display.
# Only in a PC image built with OS_KIOSK="true"; never on the Raspberry Pi.
# cage is a compositor for one full-screen program; cog is a small browser.
cage
cog
# Remote Desktop (ADR-035): Debian's RDP server, the X server its sessions
# run in, a small browser for X (cog has no X version in Debian), and a
# window manager that keeps it full screen
xrdp
xorgxrdp
xserver-xorg-core
x11-common
surf
matchbox-window-manager
# Drivers for the screen, and a font for the browser's own pages
libgl1-mesa-dri
fonts-inter
